<body>
    <h1>Partner Pricing V2: Technical Requirements</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
<style>[data-colorid=3Dkqe5pc9eqe]{color:#e3e3e3} html[data-color-mode=3Dda=
rk] [data-colorid=3Dkqe5pc9eqe]{color:#1c1c1c}[data-colorid=3Dd5m52tn00f]{c=
olor:#e3e3e3} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dd5m52tn00f]{colo=
r:#1c1c1c}[data-colorid=3Djhtgwkv1un]{color:#e3e3e3} html[data-color-mode=
=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Djhtgwkv1un]{color:#1c1c1c}[data-colorid=3Dxtp452e0=
ol]{color:#e3e3e3} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dxtp452e0ol]=
{color:#1c1c1c}[data-colorid=3Dz5qgsejv4n]{color:#e3e3e3} html[data-color-m=
ode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dz5qgsejv4n]{color:#1c1c1c}[data-colorid=3Dwfxae=
1uwba]{color:#e3e3e3} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dwfxae1uw=
ba]{color:#1c1c1c}[data-colorid=3Dnsr4x3wopi]{color:#e3e3e3} html[data-colo=
r-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dnsr4x3wopi]{color:#1c1c1c}[data-colorid=3Dio=
5u34xp9s]{color:#e3e3e3} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dio5u3=
4xp9s]{color:#1c1c1c}[data-colorid=3Duzc6npjexg]{color:#e3e3e3} html[data-c=
olor-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Duzc6npjexg]{color:#1c1c1c}</style>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #006A56;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #006A56;">
<p><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">Build-ready Salesforce require=
ments for Partner Pricing V2, including object fields, Revenue Cloud contex=
t attributes, Apex behavior, runtime outputs, and cutover validation.</span=
></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-visual-refresh aui-l=
ozenge-complete">TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS</span> <span class=3D"status-macro =
aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-visual-refresh">LAST MODIFIED: 04/24/2026</span></p=
>
<h2 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-PurposeAndScope">Purpose A=
nd Scope</h2>
<p>Partner Pricing V2 extends the existing partner pricing design by select=
ing the final partner pricing model at the quote-line level and by using a =
separate discount field set for Fortra-originated deals.</p>
<p>Build these Apex assets as part of the V2 implementation:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><code>PartnerPricingPrehookV2</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><code>PartnerPricingServiceV2</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><code>PartnerPricingPrehookV2Test</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><code>PartnerPricingServiceV2Test</code></p></li>
</ul>
<p>This specification is written for the DP2 pricing chain. Before applying=
 it in UAT, verify that UAT uses the same source files, context mapping, an=
d regional-to-partner pricing route named in this document.</p>
<h2 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-BusinessRequirements">Busi=
ness Requirements</h2>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;">
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-1.Line-LevelModelResolutio=
n">1. Line-Level Model Resolution</h3>
<p>The quote header continues to identify the partner pricing model family,=
 such as <span data-colorid=3D"d5m52tn00f"><strong><em>Discount</em></stron=
g></span> or <span data-colorid=3D"z5qgsejv4n"><strong><em>Guaranteed Margi=
n</em></strong></span>. V2 then chooses the final <span data-colorid=3D"jht=
gwkv1un"><strong><em>Partner Pricing Model</em></strong></span> record for =
each quote line by comparing the line's product hierarchy to the candidate =
model records.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;">
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-2.Deal-Type-BasedDiscountS=
election">2. Deal-Type-Based Discount Selection</h3>
<p>When the quote deal type is <span data-colorid=3D"xtp452e0ol"><strong><e=
m>Fortra Originated</em></strong></span>, V2 uses the <span data-colorid=3D=
"io5u34xp9s"><strong><em>Non-Originating</em></strong></span> percentage fi=
elds. For every other deal type, including blank values, V2 uses the standa=
rd partner pricing percentage fields.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-HierarchyResolutionOrder">=
Hierarchy Resolution Order</h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Solution Category:</strong> use a candidate model where <code>So=
lution_Category__c</code> matches the quote line.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Solution Group:</strong> if no category match exists, use a cand=
idate model where <code>Solution_Group__c</code> matches and <code>Solution=
_Category__c</code> is blank.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Unit:</strong> if no group match exists, use a candidate model w=
here <code>Unit__c</code> matches and both higher hierarchy fields are blan=
k.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Blank fallback:</strong> if no hierarchy match exists, use a mod=
el where <code>Unit__c</code>, <code>Solution_Group__c</code>, and <code>So=
lution_Category__c</code> are all blank.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>No match:</strong> if there is no fallback model, that partner c=
ontributes 0 percent on that line. Pricing continues successfully.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-DeveloperImplementationSte=
ps">Developer Implementation Steps</h2>
<p>Follow these steps to build Partner Pricing V2 in the DP2 chained pricin=
g design. The steps name the source files, object fields, context attribute=
s, and code change required for cutover.</p>
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-1.BuildTheV2ApexAssets">1.=
 Build The V2 Apex Assets</h3>
<p>Create the V2 Apex files and their metadata files. Keep <code>PartnerPri=
cingPrehook</code> and <code>PartnerPricingService</code> unchanged so the =
V1 implementation remains available for rollback.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>File</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Purpose</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>src/classes/PartnerPricingServiceV2.cls</code><br><code>src/classe=
s/PartnerPricingServiceV2.cls-meta.xml</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Reusable service logic for candidate model loading, hierarchy selection,=
 deal-type percentage selection, and price calculation.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>src/classes/PartnerPricingPrehookV2.cls</code><br><code>src/classe=
s/PartnerPricingPrehookV2.cls-meta.xml</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Revenue Cloud prehook that reads pricing context, calls the service clas=
s, and writes partner pricing outputs back to the line context.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>src/classes/PartnerPricingServiceV2Test.cls</code><br><code>src/cl=
asses/PartnerPricingServiceV2Test.cls-meta.xml</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Service-layer unit tests for effective candidate loading, hierarchy matc=
hing, duplicate handling, deal-type field selection, and pricing calculatio=
ns.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>src/classes/PartnerPricingPrehookV2Test.cls</code><br><code>src/cl=
asses/PartnerPricingPrehookV2Test.cls-meta.xml</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Prehook helper tests for partner collection, line context extraction, no=
-match behavior, and Fortra-originated discount behavior.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-2.BuildThePartnerPricingMo=
delMetadata">2. Build The Partner Pricing Model Metadata</h3>
<p>Configure <code>src/objects/Partner_Pricing_Model__c.object</code> with =
the fields below. The V2 code expects these API names exactly.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Field</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Type</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Build Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Account__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Lookup</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Stores the partner account that owns the pricing model. Candidate model =
loading filters by this field.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Model_Type__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Picklist</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Must support <code>Discount</code> and <code>Guaranteed Margin</code>. C=
andidate model loading filters by this field.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Is_Active__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Checkbox</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Only records where this field is true are eligible for V2 pricing.</p></=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Effective_Start_Date__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Date</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Records with a future start date are not eligible for V2 pricing.</p></t=
d>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Effective_End_Date__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Date</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Records with an end date before today are not eligible for V2 pricing.</=
p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Software_Percent__c</code><br><code>Subscription_Percent__c</code>=
<br><code>New_Maintenance_Percent__c</code><br><code>Renewal_Maintenance_Pe=
rcent__c</code><br><code>Services_Percent__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Percent</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Standard percentage fields used for blank deal type and every deal type =
other than <code>Fortra Originated</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Unit__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Broadest product hierarchy match when no Solution Category or Solution G=
roup model applies.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Solution_Group__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Middle product hierarchy match when no Solution Category model applies.<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Solution_Category__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Most specific product hierarchy match.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Non_Orig_Software_Pct__c</code><br><code>Non_Orig_Subscription_Pct=
__c</code><br><code>Non_Orig_New_Maint_Pct__c</code><br><code>Non_Orig_Ren_=
Maint_Pct__c</code><br><code>Non_Orig_Services_Pct__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Percent</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Discount or margin percentages used when <code>Quote.Deal_Type__c</code>=
 is <code>Fortra Originated</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-3.UpdateTheDP2QuotePricing=
ContextMapping">3. Update The DP2 Quote Pricing Context Mapping</h3>
<p>In DP2, update <code>QuoteEntitiesMapping</code> so the Revenue Cloud co=
ntext contains the exact attributes below. The V2 prehook reads these attri=
butes by API name from context. Use the attribute names exactly as listed.<=
/p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Context Node</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Attribute Name Required By V2</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>DP2 Source Value</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>SalesTransaction</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Partner_Pricing_Model__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Quote.Partner_Pricing_Model__c</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>SalesTransaction</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Deal_Type__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Quote.Deal_Type__c</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>SalesTransaction</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Billing_Partner__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Quote.Billing_Partner__c</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>SalesTransaction</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Reseller__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Quote.Reseller__c</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>SalesTransaction</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Distributor__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Quote.Distributor__c</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>SalesTransaction</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Referral_Partner__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Quote.Referral_Partner__c</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>SalesTransactionItem</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Fortra_Product_Type__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>QuoteLineItem.Fortra_Product_Type__c</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>SalesTransactionItem</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Unit__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>QuoteLineItem.Product2.Unit__c</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>SalesTransactionItem</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Solution_Group__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>QuoteLineItem.Product2.Solution_Group__c</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>SalesTransactionItem</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Solution_Category__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>QuoteLineItem.Product2.Solution_Category__c</code></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>Build requirement: <code>PartnerPricingPrehookV2</code> reads product hi=
erarchy from the <code>SalesTransactionItem</code> context attributes liste=
d above during pricing execution.</p>
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-4.MakeTheDP2ApexCutover">4=
. Make The DP2 Apex Cutover</h3>
<p>In DP2, partner pricing is called from the regional pricing prehook. Cha=
nge exactly one line in <code>src/classes/RegionalServicesPricingPrehook.cl=
s</code>.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Item</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>DP2 Value</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>File</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>src/classes/RegionalServicesPricingPrehook.cls</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>private String executePartnerPricing(RevSignaling.TransactionReque=
st request)</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Change</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Replace the V1 partner hook instantiation with the V2 partner hook insta=
ntiation.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>Before:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Partner=
PricingPrehook partnerHook =3D new PartnerPricingPrehook();
RevSignaling.TransactionResponse partnerResponse =3D partnerHook.execute(re=
quest);</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>After:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Partner=
PricingPrehookV2 partnerHook =3D new PartnerPricingPrehookV2();
RevSignaling.TransactionResponse partnerResponse =3D partnerHook.execute(re=
quest);</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Keep the existing call to <code>partnerHook.execute(request)</code> beca=
use both prehooks implement <code>RevSignaling.SignalingApexProcessor</code=
>.</p>
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-5.TestTheCutover">5. Test =
The Cutover</h3>
<p>Run the V2 test classes and the regional pricing prehook test class as p=
art of deployment validation. Include <code>RegionalServicesPricingPrehookT=
est</code> because the production regional pricing class is changed during =
cutover.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><code>PartnerPricingServiceV2Test</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><code>PartnerPricingPrehookV2Test</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><code>RegionalServicesPricingPrehookTest</code></p></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-BuildInventory">Build Inve=
ntory</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Build Area</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Required Component</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Required Action</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Apex service</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>src/classes/PartnerPricingServiceV2.cls</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create the reusable pricing service class and implement the methods list=
ed in the Service Class section.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Apex prehook</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>src/classes/PartnerPricingPrehookV2.cls</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create the Revenue Cloud prehook class and implement the context orchest=
ration methods listed in the Prehook Class section.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Apex tests</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>PartnerPricingServiceV2Test</code>, <code>PartnerPricingPrehookV2T=
est</code>, and <code>RegionalServicesPricingPrehookTest</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Build and run tests covering the service logic, prehook helper behavior,=
 and DP2 regional pricing cutover.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Object metadata</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Partner_Pricing_Model__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Add the hierarchy fields and Non-Originating percent fields listed in th=
e object-field table.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Context mapping</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>QuoteEntitiesMapping</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Add the required <code>SalesTransaction</code> and <code>SalesTransactio=
nItem</code> attributes listed in the context mapping table.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Runtime cutover</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>RegionalServicesPricingPrehook.executePartnerPricing(...)</code></=
p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Replace the V1 partner hook instantiation with <code>PartnerPricingPreho=
okV2</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-ProductTypePercentageMappi=
ng">Product Type Percentage Mapping</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
