</div>
<h2 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-ServiceClass">Service Clas=
s</h2>
<p>Copy <code>PartnerPricingService.cls</code> to <code>PartnerPricingServi=
ceV2.cls</code> and rename the class declaration to <code>PartnerPricingSer=
viceV2</code>. Keep the class as <code>public without sharing</code>. This =
class owns reusable pricing logic: candidate loading, hierarchy model selec=
tion, percentage selection, and price calculation. Keep Revenue Cloud conte=
xt orchestration in <code>PartnerPricingPrehookV2</code>.</p>
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-ClassMembers">Class Member=
s</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Class Member</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Action</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Member Type</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Build Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>DEAL_TYPE_FORTRA_ORIGINATED</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Constant</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create a private constant with value <code>Fortra Originated</code>. Use=
 this constant when deciding whether to read standard percentage fields or =
Non-Originating percentage fields.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>getPricingModel(Id, String)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove this single-record V1 lookup from V2. V2 loads all eligible candi=
date records and resolves the final model per line.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>getPricingModels(Set&lt;Id&gt;, String)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove this one-model-per-partner V1 helper from V2. V2 returns candidat=
e lists per partner.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>getPricingModelCandidates(Set&lt;Id&gt;, String)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Load all valid <code>Partner_Pricing_Model__c</code> candidate records f=
or participating partner accounts and the selected model type. Include acti=
ve records, filter out future-dated and expired records, include hierarchy =
and Non-Originating fields, and order by <code>Account__c</code> then newes=
t <code>CreatedDate</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>selectBestModelForLine(List&lt;Partner_Pricing_Model__c&gt;, Strin=
g, String, String)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Select one candidate pricing model for one quote line. Check Solution Ca=
tegory, then Solution Group, then Unit, then the blank fallback model. Beca=
use candidate records are ordered newest first, duplicate matches at the sa=
me level resolve to the newest record.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>getMarginForProductType(Partner_Pricing_Model__c, String, String)<=
/code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Modify</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Replace the V1 two-parameter method with a three-parameter method that a=
lso receives deal type. Return the applicable percentage for the quote line=
's product type and deal type. Use <code>Non_Orig_*</code> fields only when=
 the deal type is <code>Fortra Originated</code>. Otherwise use the standar=
d percentage fields. Unknown product types return 0.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>calculateGuaranteedMarginPrice(Decimal, List&lt;Decimal&gt;)</code=
></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unchanged</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Keep the V1 calculation. Add positive partner margins together, cap the =
total at 100 percent, and apply <code>List Price x (1 - total margin)</code=
>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>calculateDiscountPrice(Decimal, Decimal)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unchanged</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Keep the V1 calculation. Apply one billing-partner discount percentage u=
sing <code>List Price x (1 - discount percent)</code>. Null, zero, and nega=
tive discounts leave the price unchanged.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-PrehookClass">Prehook Clas=
s</h2>
<p>Copy <code>PartnerPricingPrehook.cls</code> to <code>PartnerPricingPreho=
okV2.cls</code> and rename the class declaration to <code>PartnerPricingPre=
hookV2</code>. Keep the class <code>global</code> and keep <code>RevSignali=
ng.SignalingApexProcessor</code>. This class is the orchestration layer. It=
 reads quote and line data from Revenue Cloud context, determines participa=
ting partners, delegates pricing decisions to <code>PartnerPricingServiceV2=
</code>, and submits line updates back to context.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;">
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-HeaderInputs">Header Input=
s</h3>
<p>The prehook reads quote-level values from the <span data-colorid=3D"uzc6=
npjexg"><strong><em>Sales Transaction</em></strong></span> context, includi=
ng partner pricing model, deal type, billing partner, reseller, distributor=
, and referral partner.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;">
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-LineInputs">Line Inputs</h=
3>
<p>The prehook reads line-level values from <span data-colorid=3D"kqe5pc9eq=
e"><strong><em>Sales Transaction Item</em></strong></span>, including produ=
ct type, unit, solution group, and solution category.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;">
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-PartnerParticipation">Part=
ner Participation</h3>
<p>For <span data-colorid=3D"wfxae1uwba"><strong><em>Discount</em></strong>=
</span>, only the billing partner contributes. For <span data-colorid=3D"ns=
r4x3wopi"><strong><em>Guaranteed Margin</em></strong></span>, billing partn=
er, reseller, distributor, and referral partner can contribute when those p=
artners are present on the quote.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;">
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-No-MatchBehavior">No-Match=
 Behavior</h3>
<p>When no applicable pricing model is found, the affected partner contribu=
tes 0 percent and pricing continues successfully.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<h3 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-ClassMembers.1">Class Memb=
ers</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Class Member</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Action</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Member Type</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Build Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>MODEL_GUARANTEED_MARGIN</code>, <code>MODEL_DISCOUNT</code></p></t=
d>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unchanged</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Constants</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Keep the V1 constants with values <code>Guaranteed Margin</code> and <co=
de>Discount</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>QuoteHeaderData</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Modify</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Inner class</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Store quote-level context values: quote id, billing partner id, reseller=
 id, distributor id, referral partner id, partner pricing model type, and d=
eal type. Include a helper that identifies whether the quote has the minimu=
m required partner pricing inputs.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>LineItemContextData</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Inner class</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Store line-level context values: line item id, product type, unit, solut=
ion group, and solution category.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>PartnerMarginDetail</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unchanged</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Inner class</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Store partner id, partner name, partner role, and percentage contributio=
n. Provide a method that converts the detail to a map for JSON serializatio=
n into <code>Partner_Margin_Detail__c</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>execute(RevSignaling.TransactionRequest)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Modify</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Read the context instance id, query quote header data, clear stale partn=
er pricing fields when required header inputs are missing, load participati=
ng partner models, process all line items, submit context updates, and retu=
rn <code>SUCCESS</code> with a readable message.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>queryQuoteHeaderFromContext(String)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Modify</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Query the <code>SalesTransaction</code> context node and populate <code>=
QuoteHeaderData</code> with <code>Partner_Pricing_Model__c</code>, <code>De=
al_Type__c</code>, <code>Billing_Partner__c</code>, <code>Reseller__c</code=
>, <code>Distributor__c</code>, and <code>Referral_Partner__c</code>.</p></=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>collectPartnerIds(QuoteHeaderData)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unchanged</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>For <code>Discount</code>, return only the billing partner id. For <code=
>Guaranteed Margin</code>, return billing partner, reseller, distributor, a=
nd referral partner ids when present.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>loadPartnerPricingModels(Set&lt;Id&gt;, String)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Modify</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Delegate to <code>PartnerPricingServiceV2.getPricingModelCandidates</cod=
e> and return a map of partner account id to ordered candidate model list.<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>getPartnerNames(Set&lt;Id&gt;)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unchanged</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Keep the V1 account-name lookup helper for partner margin detail output.=
</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>processLineItems(...)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Modify</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Query <code>SalesTransactionItem</code> context data, build the line con=
text map, process each line, collect non-null line updates, and submit the =
updates through the context API.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>buildLineItemContextDataById(List&lt;Map&lt;String, Object&gt;&gt;=
)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Build a map from line item record id to <code>LineItemContextData</code>=
 so each line can reuse parsed context values during pricing.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>buildLineItemContextData(Map&lt;String, Object&gt;)</code></p></td=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Extract <code>Fortra_Product_Type__c</code>, <code>Unit__c</code>, <code=
>Solution_Group__c</code>, and <code>Solution_Category__c</code> from one <=
code>SalesTransactionItem</code> context payload.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>processLineItem(...)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Modify</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Determine current price from <code>UnitPrice</code> with <code>ListPrice=
</code> fallback, resolve hierarchy values from line context, select the be=
st model for the line, calculate the partner-adjusted price, and return the=
 context update map for that line.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>getPartnerRole(Id, QuoteHeaderData)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unchanged</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Return <code>Billing Partner</code>, <code>Reseller</code>, <code>Distri=
butor</code>, <code>Referral Partner</code>, or <code>Unknown</code> based =
on the matching quote header partner id.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>submitContextUpdates(...)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unchanged</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Call <code>updateContextAttributes</code> with the line update payload b=
uilt by <code>processLineItem</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>extractFieldValue(...)</code>, <code>getStringFromTag(...)</code>,=
 <code>getDecimalFromTag(...)</code>, <code>getIdFromTag(...)</code></p></t=
d>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unchanged</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Methods</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Support both direct values and nested <code>tagValue</code> structures r=
eturned by Revenue Cloud context APIs. Return null for missing fields and c=
onversion failures.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>isModelEffective(Partner_Pricing_Model__c, Date)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove this V1 helper from V2 because candidate eligibility is handled i=
n <code>PartnerPricingServiceV2.getPricingModelCandidates</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>buildMarginDetailJson(...)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove this V1 helper from V2. Serialize the partner margin detail direc=
tly from the <code>PartnerMarginDetail</code> maps built during line proces=
sing.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>clearPartnerPricingFields(String)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unchanged</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Clear partner pricing output attributes from all line items when the quo=
te lacks required partner pricing header inputs.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>processLineItemsWithWarningOnly(...)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove this V1 warning-only path from V2. V2 line processing handles mis=
sing model matches as 0 percent partner contribution.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>buildWarningOnlyUpdate(...)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove this V1 warning-only update helper from V2.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>buildMissingModelWarning(...)</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Method</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Remove this V1 missing-model warning helper from V2. V2 applies hierarch=
y fallback and writes normal pricing outputs for each processed line.</p></=
td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-RuntimeOutputs">Runtime Ou=
tputs</h2>
<p>The V2 prehook writes partner pricing results back to the line context. =
These values support downstream pricing display and audit visibility.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Output Attribute</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Meaning</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Pre_Partner_Price__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The price before the partner pricing adjustment. In this pricing chain, =
it represents the price after regional pricing has already run.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Partner_Adjusted_Price__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The calculated price after partner pricing is applied.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Partner_Pricing_Model_Applied__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The partner pricing model family selected on the quote, such as <code>Di=
scount</code> or <code>Guaranteed Margin</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Partner_Pricing_Source__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Set to <code>System Calculated</code> when V2 calculates the partner pri=
cing result.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Partner_Margin_Detail__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>JSON detail showing partner role and contribution percentage when applic=
able.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>PartnerUnitPrice</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Revenue Cloud standard partner unit price value for display and downstre=
am pricing behavior.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>PartnerDiscountPercent</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Total partner discount or margin percentage written for Revenue Cloud di=
splay.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>Partner_Pricing_Warning__c</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Cleared when the normal V2 line-pricing path completes.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-TestCoverage">Test Coverag=
e</h2>
<p>Build test coverage for service-layer calculations, candidate loading, h=
ierarchy selection, deal-type-specific field selection, and prehook helper =
behavior.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Test Class</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Coverage Areas</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>PartnerPricingServiceV2Test</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Valid candidate loading, effective-date filtering, hierarchy selection, =
newest-created duplicate handling, standard vs Non-Originating percentage s=
election, discount calculation, and guaranteed-margin calculation.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>PartnerPricingPrehookV2Test</code></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Prehook instantiation, helper behavior, candidate loading delegation, no=
-match discount behavior, Fortra-originated discount behavior, context hier=
archy extraction, partner collection, partner role labeling, and clearing b=
ehavior for invalid context.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>Perform an integration test in a pricing-enabled org to validate end-to-=
end execution of <code>execute(RevSignaling.TransactionRequest)</code>.</p>
<h2 id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:TechnicalRequirements-ReleaseValidation">Release=
 Validation</h2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Confirm the V2 object fields exist on <code>Partner_Pricing_Model__c</co=
de>: <code>Unit__c</code>, <code>Solution_Group__c</code>, <code>Solution_C=
ategory__c</code>, and the <code>Non_Orig_*</code> percentage fields.</p></=
li>
<li>
<p>Confirm the quote-pricing context provides <code>Deal_Type__c</code> on =
<code>SalesTransaction</code>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Confirm <code>SalesTransactionItem</code> provides <code>Fortra_Product_=
Type__c</code>, <code>Unit__c</code>, <code>Solution_Group__c</code>, and <=
code>Solution_Category__c</code>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Confirm partner pricing model data follows the expected pattern of one p=
opulated hierarchy field per model record, with blank hierarchy fields used=
 for fallback records.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Confirm inactive, future-dated, and expired partner pricing model record=
s are ignored.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Maintain one active record per partner, model type, and hierarchy level.=
 If duplicates exist at the same hierarchy level, the newest record will be=
 selected.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Update and validate the pricing route so the partner pricing step execut=
es <code>PartnerPricingPrehookV2</code>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Run UAT scenarios for category match, group fallback, unit fallback, bla=
nk fallback, no model match, Fortra-originated discount selection, standard=
 discount selection, and Guaranteed Margin with multiple partner roles.</p>=
</li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
